<title>USA: Xpedite in agreement with Maximizer.</title>
<headline>Xpedite in agreement with Maximizer.</headline>
<dateline>EATONTOWN, N.J. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xpedite Systems Inc has agreed to make its enhanced fax services available through Maximizer Technologies's database programs, Xpedite said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Xpedite deals in fax and electronic document delivery. Maximizer equips sales professionals, corporate management and other business users with contact information and business data.</p>
</text>
